Lot cost balances preserve units and currency display.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity AAPL
  format 1000 AAPL
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Bank
account Income:Capital Gains

P 2024-02-01 AAPL 120 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 AAPL {{1000 USD}}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD

2024-02-01 Partial sale
  Assets:Broker  -4 AAPL {100 USD} @ 120 USD
  Assets:Bank  480 USD
  Income:Capital Gains  -80 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

-520.00 USD   Assets:Bank
   6    AAPL  Assets:Broker
 -80.00 USD   Income:Capital Gains
